OL,3,GNEWSASuspected illegal tobacco seized
OL,4,Ain shop raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 3,000 illicit cigarettes have
OL,7,Fbeen discovered during a raid of a
OL,8,Fconvenience store.
OL,10,FCentral Bedfordshire Council's trading
OL,11,Fstandards said 3,160 cigarettes and 195
OL,12,Fpackets of hand-rolling tobacco - worth
OL,13,Fmore than #70,000, were found at The
OL,14,FDunstable Local Grocery, on High Street
OL,15,FNorth, on Thursday.
OL,17,FCouncillor Liz Childs, executive member
OL,18,Ffor public protection, said there had
OL,19,Fbeen a focus on the town for the "scale
OL,20,Fand persistence" of illegal tobacco and
OL,21,Fvape sales.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
